From 3fc499ff87ca04d1b0b9ec36818600f5d1b12192 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NikSun <candysfm@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:51:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ble): resume audio without redundant idle updates

Edit activity reset the idle attempt guard while leaving the link at 120 ms. A repeated idle update could hold NimBLE pending for 40 seconds, causing every audio request to return EALREADY until capture timed out.

Reuse the negotiated idle link and track only accepted idle updates. Exercise the worker policy with a fake BLE host and clock: the captured edit/idle/UP sequence now resumes at 220 ms instead of failing at 1500 ms. Keep the low-power interval, retry deadline, and cancellation behavior.
---
